  "description": "Shared test vectors for the local file scope of a CEF tab: a file: page may load file: subresources and subframes only from its own folder or below, the folder WebKit grants with loadFileURL(_:allowingReadAccessTo:). C++ LocalFileSubresourceAllowed (CEFShim/src/local_file_scope.h, scripts/cmux-next/test-local-file-scope-cpp.sh) passes these. `allowed` is false when the shim cancels the request. A request that is not file: is left to Chromium (true), and so is a file: request from a known web document (http, https, chrome-extension, chrome, chrome-untrusted, devtools, cmux-page), which Chromium refuses itself. A file: request from any other document is refused: one the shim cannot place (empty, about:, data:, filesystem:, blob:), an unknown scheme, or a URL that does not start with its scheme. `document` is the requesting frame's URL after the shim walks about: frames up to their parent; a frameless request reaches the policy with an empty document.",
